# ADR-0150 builds the image from a clean clone with `COPY . .`, so everything a developer's working
# tree accumulates would otherwise become image context — and, worse, could shadow what the build
# produces. `frontend/dist` and the static directory are listed for that second reason: a stale
# local build must never win over the one the node stage just made.
.git
.gradle
build
*/build
node_modules
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
nodqora-app/src/main/resources/static
.idea
*.iml
*.log
.DS_Store
